==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Sharp Fang'''{{'}}s Japanese name is that of the [[Razor Fang]], a [[held item]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Hidden Legends|Golbat|36}} from the {{TCG|EX Hidden Legends}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

